Package: StateCommute
Type: Package
Title: Pathway-Level Characterization of Cell States via irGSEA, NMF and Redundancy Reduction
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Yu", "L", email = "yl@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A workflow for characterizing disease-associated cell states at the
    pathway level. It scores gene sets per cell with irGSEA (AUCell), factorizes
    the resulting pathway x cell matrix with non-negative matrix factorization
    (NMF) to recover functional modules, clusters cells into states, and collapses
    redundant pathways per state by gene-set overlap similarity. A bridge function
    links NMF modules to the overlap-based reduction, using NMF loadings to pick
    representative pathways for each state.
